      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**How to read this board.** *Measured* quality means a person checked a sample; it is shown with its sample size and date, under **Human review**. Everything else is a proxy: counts, statuses, and scores that are **uncalibrated** rule or model scores, not probabilities. An **AI audit** is shown in its own panel and is not a human evaluation; the two are never added together."
      }
